OL,3,GNEWSAWe were scammed by car cloning
OL,4,Acriminals - it's happening all the time
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who saved #6,000 for her dream
OL,7,Fcampervan, an 84-year-old who received
OL,8,Fnine penalty notices for offences she
OL,9,Fdid not commit, and a family whose cars
OL,10,Fwere stolen from outside their home
OL,11,Fhave all fallen victim to car cloning.
OL,13,FThe victims of the fraud- where
OL,14,Fcriminals give a stolen car the
OL,15,Fidentity of another almost identical
OL,16,Fcar - say they are shocked at how often
OL,17,Fit is happening and want to warn other
OL,18,Fmotorists.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
