OL,3,GNEWSAWe were scammed by car cloning
OL,4,Acriminals - it's happening all the time
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice say they are seeing more cloned
OL,7,Fcars on the roads, with one officer
OL,8,Freporting the number of cases he
OL,9,Fexamines has more than doubled since
OL,10,F2023.
OL,12,F"I kept thinking 'would these people do
OL,13,Fthis to their own mother or aging
OL,14,Fgrandmother?'" said Christine Balson,
OL,15,F84.
